  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups all-purpose flour, divided, or more as needed",
    "2 (.25 ounce) packages dry yeast",
    "1 cup milk",
    "0.75 cup water",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3rjBQSpWfeYL9L3v7bDhkhktOE4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6761-tasty-buns-DDMFS-step-1-bddc7a7ef60f4985af0a7004736461f1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6761/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir 2 cups flour and yeast together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VxpJLF7L8rFpd_Q3Zd-_bQUi2fE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6761-tasty-buns-DDMFS-step-2-799a9071243342ba802750925e9ef042.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6761/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat milk, water, oil, sugar, and salt together in a microwave-safe bowl in the microwave until lukewarm; add to flour mixture and beat until smooth, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N8EtTw11lRrI0bacYIsBxWUKFFQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6761-tasty-buns-DDMFS-step-3-eb1adb84c5eb4c5e98cb3423e437ec1a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6761/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in 2 cups remaining flour, then add up to 1 cup more flour as necessary to make a soft dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9gVB4vg8ow7lxxUbYP0aVZQMGnw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6761-tasty-buns-DDMFS-step-4-b0611aa5bd654d4fa8cabd9ac8ac229e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6761/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dust a flat surface with flour; turn dough out onto floured surface and let rest under a bowl for about 10 minutes. Meanwhile, lightly grease a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ezJDBdfypBPLu2X3zF-xcinOVGM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6761-tasty-buns-DDMFS-step-5-3c287a1ea0fb493992ba2bfee84e7d55.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6761/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape dough into 12 slightly flat balls and place on the prepared baking sheet to rise until doubled in size.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ih64AeKjsRlisNDtN-x0bVlBFN0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6761-tasty-buns-DDMFS-step-7-7dc4f952bea24f2f85e47eaf9ee33219.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6761/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Bake in the preheated oven for 12 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nKri1LDAcUV3cRIIt_3s_BoV9X4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6761-tasty-buns-DDMFS-step-8-3b2af6b385fa4cdd8e833a1b981524a6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6761/step_07.webp"
    }
